Note that this function assumes that adjectives will always appear adjacent to each other, which may not be strictly true in all cases. You could modify the function to handle more complex scenarios by keeping track of whether a given word is an adjective or not, and only swapping adjacent adjectives. However, this would require more sophisticated logic and possibly a lookup table or dictionary.

