The longest palindromic substring in "ooqoyqoooqqqoyy" is "qoyqoo". Its length is 7, which is greater than the length of any other palindromic substring in this string. The start and end indices of this substring are (5, 11). Therefore, the function to solve this problem can be implemented as follows:

